18
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.166
Simplemente vive bien en el futuro.

19
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:33.666
Yo...

20
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:34.933
Brenna,

21
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:36.033
Brenna,

22
